      "hiddenInfo": "Evermeet physically shifts between the Material Plane, the Feywild, and Arvandor; navigation requires magical keys. There is a prison beneath the capital holding drow who sought redemption but failed the tests. The royal family possesses a Dragon Stone that can compel metallic dragons to aid the isle in times of crisis.",
