    "Luiren and Dambrath": {
      "name": "Luiren and Dambrath",
      "basicInfo": "Luiren is the ancestral homeland of the Halflings (Hin). Though devastated by the Spellplague floods, it has rebuilt. It is a land of small, comfortable burrows and fierce defenders. To the east lies Dambrath, a nation historically ruled by the Crinti (Half-Drow), though recent rebellions have shaken their power. It is a land of horse-lords and worship of Loviatar (Goddess of Pain).",
