      "basicInfo": "A legendary land of magic enclosed by high mountain walls. Famous for its Skyships and the fact that nearly every citizen uses magic. During the Spellplague, the entire nation vanished (shifting to Abeir) and recently returned. They are isolationists, protecting their magical secrets. The architecture is elegant, and the weather is controlled by wizards.",
