    "Durpar and Var (The Shining Lands)": {
      "name": "Durpar and Var (The Shining Lands)",
      "basicInfo": "Located in the far southeast, these lands are defined by the philosophy of 'The Adama' (The One), which teaches that divinity is found in everything, especially honest trade. It is a merchant's paradise where business deals are sacred rituals. The land is rich in spices, gems, and silks. Var is the agricultural breadbasket for the trading cities of Durpar.",
