      "basicInfo": "A honeycomb of ancient, colossal halls and tunnels extending beneath Amn, Tethyr, and Calimshan. Once the seat of the eight great dwarven kingdoms of Deep Shanatar, it is now a graveyard of fallen empires overrun by drow, mind flayers, and duergar.",
