    "Avernus": {
      "name": "Avernus",
      "basicInfo": "The first layer of the Nine Hells, a vast battlefield of fire, blood, and iron ruled by the archduke Zariel. It is the mustering ground for the infernal legions fighting in the Blood War against the demons of the Abyss. The landscape is a charred wasteland of craters, fortresses, and rivers of boiling blood, with the River Styx flowing through to connect to the lower layers. Mortal souls arrive here first after damnation, to be sorted and sent to their final torment.",
