    "Dis": {
      "name": "Dis",
      "basicInfo": "The second layer of Hell, an endless iron metropolis ruled by the archduke Dispater. The entire layer is a single, sprawling city of iron towers, smog-filled streets, and relentless industry. Dispater rules from the Iron Tower, a fortress of impenetrable metal, and is known for his paranoia, never leaving his sanctum. The city serves as the main trading hub of the Hells, where devils forge weapons, armor, and infernal contracts.",
