    "Minauros": {
      "name": "Minauros",
      "basicInfo": "The third layer of Hell, a foul swamp of disease, decay, and endless rain ruled by the archduke Mammon. Minauros is a realm of filth, where polluted rivers, quicksand bogs, and rotting vegetation stretch to the horizon. Mammon resides in the city of Minauros, an opulent but crumbling metropolis built on endless pilings above the mire. He is the greediest of the archdevils and serves as Hell's treasurer.",
