    "Phlegethos": {
      "name": "Phlegethos",
      "basicInfo": "The fourth layer of Hell, a realm of fire, magma, and unending torment ruled by the archduchess Fierna and her father Belial. It is a volcanic wasteland of black glass and rivers of molten rock, where the souls of the damned are consumed and reformed endlessly. Fierna governs openly while Belial operates from the shadows, manipulating her and the court. The city of Abriymoch is built into the caldera of a massive volcano.",
