    "Stygia": {
      "name": "Stygia",
      "basicInfo": "The fifth layer of Hell, a frozen ocean of icebergs, crushing pressure, and forgotten secrets ruled by the archduke Levistus. Levistus is imprisoned in an immense iceberg, frozen solid as punishment for an ancient betrayal against Asmodeus. The layer is a realm of ice, freezing storms, and the submerged ruins of a primordial city. Intrepid devils and damned souls navigate the treacherous floes in search of lost knowledge.",
