    "Malbolge": {
      "name": "Malbolge",
      "basicInfo": "The sixth layer of Hell, once an infinite mountain slope of rockfalls and torment, now a realm of living flesh ruled by the archduchess Glasya, daughter of Asmodeus. After the Reckoning, Glasya reshaped the layer into a grotesque landscape where the terrain itself is made of living, tortured bodies that scream and writhe. She is the warden of Hell's prison system and the mistress of infernal assassins.",
