    "Maladomini": {
      "name": "Maladomini",
      "basicInfo": "The seventh layer of Hell, a plane of ruined cities, black sludge, and unceasing construction ruled by the archduke Baalzebul. Once beautiful, the layer is now a shattered wasteland because Baalzebul, cursed by Asmodeus, can never complete any of his grand works. Every city he builds inevitably collapses into ruin, and the land is filled with the husks of failed architectural marvels. Baalzebul rules from the broken capital of Malagard.",
