    "Cania": {
      "name": "Cania",
      "basicInfo": "The eighth layer of Hell, an arctic wasteland of unthinkable cold ruled by the archduke Mephistopheles. It is a realm of glaciers, frozen methane lakes, and monumental structures carved from blue-black ice. Mephistopheles is the greatest wizard among the archdevils, and his palace, Mephistar, is built on the warm geothermal vent that allows life to survive. He is obsessed with arcane research and experiments that rival those of the gods themselves.",
