      "hiddenInfo": "Mephistopheles has been quietly harvesting the energy of the souls of dead gods from the Astral Plane, using it to fuel a weapon that could theoretically unmake Asmodeus. He has also created a copy of the Pact Primeval that could, if validated, strip the Lord of the Nine of his divine mandate.",
