    "Nessus": {
      "name": "Nessus",
      "basicInfo": "The ninth and deepest layer of Hell, the domain of Asmodeus, the Lord of the Nine. Nessus is a realm of jagged chasms, eternal lightning, and impossibly ancient citadels. At its center stands Malsheem, the fortress-temple of Asmodeus, where he sits on his throne and orchestrates the grand strategy of the devils. The landscape is shaped by the will of Asmodeus, and the very ground seems to whisper his name. Entry is forbidden to all but the most powerful archdevils, and even they must be summoned.",
