      "hiddenInfo": "Beneath Malsheem lies the Pit of Flame, the original wound in reality from which Asmodeus first emerged. It is the source of all infernal power and the prison of the dying god He Who Was, whose divine essence Asmodeus drained to fuel his own ascension. Anyone who reaches the Pit could theoretically challenge Asmodeus for control of Hell.",
