        "The Sha'sal Khou (Anti-Vlaakith rebels)",
        "Illithid Hunters (hidden)"
      ],
      "hiddenInfo": "The Lich-Queen consumes the souls of all githyanki who reach level 16 to sustain her immortality, a secret known only to her inner circle. The Sha'sal Khou, a secret society of rebels, seeks to overthrow her and unite the gith people. They have hidden agents throughout the city, and their leader, a mysterious figure known only as 'The Liberator', is rumoured to be a githzerai monk who has achieved enlightenment.",
      "realm": "Astral Plane"
