    "Astral Wilderness": {
      "name": "Astral Wilderness",
      "basicInfo": "The endless, silver void beyond the known settlements. Here, the Astral Plane is a realm of drifting debris, forgotten memories, and the ruins of dead civilisations. The only constants are the stars and the occasional flicker of a colour pool leading to another plane. Travellers must navigate by instinct or by the guidance of astral beacons. Danger lurks in the form of astral pirates, psychic predators, and the lost souls of those who have become untethered from time. It is a place of profound isolation, where the mind can be lost in the infinite silence.",
      "x": 0,
