        "Lost Souls",
        "Void traders (rare)"
      ],
      "hiddenInfo": "Deep within the wilderness drifts the 'Husk of the First Illithid Empire', a petrified nautiloid fleet from an age long past. It is rumoured to contain a functioning mind flayer elder brain, trapped in stasis, which could unlock the secrets of the original gith rebellion if awakened.",
      "realm": "Astral Plane"
