        "Hellrider Memorial": {
          "description": "A crude monument erected on the northern rim, built from melted shields, broken swords, and cavalry banners recovered from the crater's edge. It lists the names of all Hellrider companies lost when Elturel fell. A pair of grizzled paladins of Torm maintain a constant vigil here, accepting alms for the refugees and recording the names of the missing. A faint holy aura clings to the site, offering a small respite from the crater's oppressive atmosphere.",
