          "paths": [
            "The Crater Rim",
            "The Scar"
          ]
        },
        "The Scar": {
          "description": "The deepest point of the crater, a fissure of cracked obsidian and residual infernal energy. The air here is unnaturally hot, and the ground trembles. A faint, blood-red glow emanates from the crack, and the distant screams of the damned can be heard. The Scar is the remnant portal that connected the Companion to Avernus; while mostly sealed, it is unstable, and a merrenoloth has been known to ferry desperate souls willing to pay in soul coins. The Order of the Companion has posted guards here to prevent devil incursions, but they are undermanned.",
          "paths": [
            "Descent to the Scar"
          ]
        }
      },
      "factions": [
