        "Refugee survivors led by Sarissa Thornwind",
        "Devil scavengers and stray lemures"
      ],
      "difficultyTier": "3",
      "hiddenInfo": "The Scar is not merely a crack to Avernus — it is a wound in the Weave itself, a place where divine and infernal magic intertwined catastrophically. Prelate Madros has discovered that if the Sword of Zariel is brought to the Scar and plunged into the ground, it could potentially reopen the portal wide enough to return Elturel to Faerûn — but doing so would require the blood sacrifice of a redeemed celestial, and might also allow Zariel's legions to pour through.",
