            "The Beast-Spirits' Hollow"
          ]
        },
        "The Trading Glade": {
          "description": "A glade where the free folk trade the goods of the wild — furs, herbs, carved wood, wild honey, and the crafted tokens of the wandering life — in the simple, trustful barter of those who own little and share much. There are no coins in Shurrock and no haggling to speak of; the trade is open-handed and generous, an exchange of gifts as much as goods. Wanderers come here to provision themselves for long journeys into the wild, and to trade news along with wares, for in trackless Shurrock, word passes hand to hand at gatherings like this.",
          "paths": [
            "The Great Clearing",
            "The Wanderers' Camp"
          ]
        },
        "The Beast-Spirits' Hollow": {
          "description": "A sheltered hollow at the clearing's edge where the noble beast-spirits — great stags, bears, wolves, and eagles wiser than any mortal beast — gather and where those who would speak with them may come with proper respect. The beast-spirits are the wild's oldest guardians, and their counsel is prized above almost any other in Shurrock, for they feel the health of the whole living wilderness in their very bones. Of late they have grown uneasy, and their unease is the surest sign that something is wrong in the deep forests.",
          "paths": [
            "The Wardens' Fire",
            "The Sacred Grove"
          ]
        },
        "The Trailheads": {
          "description": "The place where the game-trails and wandering-paths of Shurrock converge on Wardenmeet, the closest thing the trackless wild has to a crossroads. From here the trails lead out to every corner of the wild paradise — into the deep old-growth forests, up toward the soaring peaks, down into the hidden valleys, along the clean rushing rivers, and to the sacred groves and secret glens. Wanderers gather at the trailheads to find guides, share route-lore, and set out into the vast free wilderness, and it is here a visitor learns the ways into the whole of Shurrock.",
          "paths": [
