            "The Deep Forest Verge"
          ]
        },
        "The Sacred Grove": {
          "description": "A grove of the most ancient trees near Wardenmeet, tended by the grove-keepers as a holy place where the spirit of the wild runs strongest and purest. The grove is a place of profound peace and power, its great trees humming with the deep life of unspoiled nature, and the free folk come here to honor the wilderness and to be renewed by its untamed goodness. The grove-keepers watch it with special care, for a sacred grove is exactly the kind of place a patient fiend would seek to corrupt, poisoning the wild's purest heart to spread rot through the whole living network.",
          "paths": [
