            "The Earthberg Edge",
            "The Fallen Field"
          ]
        },
        "The Valkyries' Aerie": {
          "description": "The high aerie of the valkyries who choose the slain and shepherd the cycle of death and rebirth, now troubled by the failing of their sacred charge.",
          "paths": [
            "The Feast-Hall",
