      "description": "You consecrate a vast area of ground and conjure an immense temple dedicated to your deity to rise from the earth in its centre. The structure is fully furnished, warded against hostile creatures of other alignments, and grants healing benefits to those who rest within.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Conjuration",
          "amount": 35
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 35,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "CANTRIP - Infestation": {
      "name": "CANTRIP - Infestation",
      "description": "You conjure a swarm of insects that briefly overwhelms a nearby creature, biting and stinging before dispersing. The discomfort and pain of the swarm causes the target to jerk unpredictably in a random direction.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Illusion",
          "amount": 1
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 1,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIRST LEVEL - Illusory Script": {
      "name": "FIRST LEVEL - Illusory Script",
      "description": "You inscribe a hidden message onto a piece of parchment that appears to anyone reading it as innocuous text of your choosing. Only creatures you designate can see the true message underneath, making this ideal for sending secret correspondence through hostile hands.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Illusion",
          "amount": 5
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 5,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SECOND LEVEL - Magic Mouth": {
      "name": "SECOND LEVEL - Magic Mouth",
      "description": "You enchant an object or surface with a hidden sensor and a pre-recorded message that activates when a specific trigger condition you designate is met. The enchanted spot speaks the message in your voice and can perform simple gestures if it has any form of face.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Illusion",
          "amount": 10
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 10,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SECOND LEVEL - Nystul's Magic Aura": {
      "name": "SECOND LEVEL - Nystul's Magic Aura",
      "description": "You overlay an object or creature with a false magical signature, causing divinations to either detect illusions of your choosing or to return no trace of magic at all. The aura can disguise a magical blade as mundane or a plain ring as a relic of great power.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Illusion",
          "amount": 10
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 10,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SIXTH LEVEL - Mental Prison": {
      "name": "SIXTH LEVEL - Mental Prison",
      "description": "You implant a terrifying illusory trap in a target's mind that only they can perceive, causing them to see themselves surrounded by a deadly hazard of your choosing. Any attempt to move results in phantasmal but very real psychic damage as their mind insists the danger is genuine.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Illusion",
          "amount": 30
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 30,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SEVENTH LEVEL - Simulacrum": {
      "name": "SEVENTH LEVEL - Simulacrum",
      "description": "You craft a frozen-snow duplicate of a creature you have access to, an illusory copy that possesses roughly half the original's power and obeys your commands faithfully. The simulacrum does not recover naturally and vanishes if destroyed, making each one a finite and precious asset.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Illusion",
          "amount": 35
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 35,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIRST LEVEL - Detect Evil and Good": {
      "name": "FIRST LEVEL - Detect Evil and Good",
      "description": "You open your senses to detect the presence of aberrations, celestials, elementals, fey, fiends, or undead within range. You also perceive any place or object that has been consecrated or desecrated with divine power.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Divination",
          "amount": 5
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 5,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIRST LEVEL - Beast Bond": {
      "name": "FIRST LEVEL - Beast Bond",
      "description": "You forge a momentary empathic link with a nearby beast, allowing you to share sensory information with it and communicate simple concepts telepathically. The bond is strongest with animals of modest intellect and wanes if the creature strays too far from you.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Divination",
          "amount": 5
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 5,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SECOND LEVEL - Locate Animals or Plants": {
      "name": "SECOND LEVEL - Locate Animals or Plants",
      "description": "You name a specific kind of beast or plant and extend your awareness outward to sense the nearest example of it within a vast radius. You learn the direction and distance to the creature or plant without needing to see it directly.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Divination",
          "amount": 10
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 10,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIFTH LEVEL - Commune with Nature": {
      "name": "FIFTH LEVEL - Commune with Nature",
      "description": "You merge your awareness briefly with the surrounding wilderness, gaining intimate knowledge of the area for several miles around — terrain, bodies of water, prevalent creatures, powerful fey, and any unnatural disturbances. The spell only works in natural settings and is blinded by urban environments.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Divination",
          "amount": 25
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 25,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "EIGHTH LEVEL - Glibness": {
      "name": "EIGHTH LEVEL - Glibness",
      "description": "You charge your voice and bearing with an overwhelming aura of disarming honesty that makes every word you speak ring with unshakeable credibility. For the duration, you cannot be caught in a lie by divination magic, and your persuasive efforts succeed at the highest possible conviction.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Divination",
          "amount": 40
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 40,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIRST LEVEL - Arms of Hadar": {
      "name": "FIRST LEVEL - Arms of Hadar",
      "description": "You call forth writhing tendrils of dark energy from the Far Realm that erupt outward from your body, lashing at every creature within reach. Those struck by the grasping limbs are drained of vitality and temporarily unable to retaliate effectively.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 5
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 5,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIRST LEVEL - Cause Fear": {
      "name": "FIRST LEVEL - Cause Fear",
      "description": "You fill a creature's mind with overwhelming dread of their own mortality, gripping them with paralysing supernatural fear. The victim cannot willingly move toward you and struggles to act effectively while the terror holds.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Enchantment",
          "amount": 5
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 5,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "THIRD LEVEL - Feign Death": {
      "name": "THIRD LEVEL - Feign Death",
      "description": "You touch a willing creature and plunge them into a deathlike catalepsy that fools even careful observers into believing they have died. The creature is aware of their surroundings throughout the deception and wakes unharmed when the spell ends.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 15
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 15,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "THIRD LEVEL - Revivify": {
      "name": "THIRD LEVEL - Revivify",
      "description": "You touch a creature that has died within the last minute and channel a surge of restorative energy that catches their fleeing soul and drags it back into their body. The resurrected creature returns with a sliver of life and needs immediate healing to recover.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 15
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 15,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FOURTH LEVEL - Life Transference": {
      "name": "FOURTH LEVEL - Life Transference",
      "description": "You deliberately wound yourself, drawing forth your own vital energy and funnelling it into another creature you touch as a powerful healing surge. The recipient receives nearly double the life force you surrender, making this a brutally efficient rescue spell.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 20
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 20,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIFTH LEVEL - Negative Energy Flood": {
      "name": "FIFTH LEVEL - Negative Energy Flood",
      "description": "You release a surge of raw necromantic energy into a creature that wracks their body with mortifying cold and deathly weight. A humanoid slain by this power rises seconds later as a zombie bound to your will.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 25
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 25,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIFTH LEVEL - Enervation": {
      "name": "FIFTH LEVEL - Enervation",
      "description": "You project a tendril of shadowy necrotic energy that latches onto a creature and continues to drain their vitality each round until the spell ends or they escape line of sight. The stolen life force flows back to you, restoring your own wounds with each pulse.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 25
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 25,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SIXTH LEVEL - Magic Jar": {
      "name": "SIXTH LEVEL - Magic Jar",
      "description": "You trap your own soul inside a specially prepared vessel, then project your consciousness out to possess the body of another creature within range. You can body-hop between hosts and the vessel, abandoning damaged bodies as they fall and seizing new ones as opportunity allows.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 30
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 30,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SIXTH LEVEL - Soul Cage": {
      "name": "SIXTH LEVEL - Soul Cage",
      "description": "You intercept the soul of a humanoid that dies within arm's reach and trap it in a specially prepared receptacle. The captured soul can be drained for a variety of grim benefits — healing, knowledge, or power — until the cage is spent or destroyed.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 30
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 30,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "SEVENTH LEVEL - Resurrection": {
      "name": "SEVENTH LEVEL - Resurrection",
      "description": "You call the soul of a creature that has been dead for up to a century back into a restored body that you mend as the spell completes. The resurrected creature returns whole and healthy, though the magic requires substantial material components to perform.",
      "requirements": [
        {
          "type": "skill",
          "variable": "Necromancy",
          "amount": 35
        }
      ],
      "bonus": 35,
      "cooldown": 0
    },
    "FIRST LEVEL - Compelled Duel": {
      "name": "FIRST LEVEL - Compelled Duel",
