    "Form of Dread": {
      "name": "Form of Dread",
      "description": "Your patron lends you its face when you ask, and you have learned to ask at excellent moments. Flesh pales, eyes hollow, something vast and grave-cold looks out through you, and whoever was mid-sentence generally stops.",
